-   malloc_chunks.  It is allocated with mmap() and always starts at an
-   address aligned to HEAP_MAX_SIZE.  */
+   malloc_chunks.  Its address has the process-wide arena_offset residue
+   modulo heap_max_size ().  The offset also respects huge-page alignment.  */
 
